Package: pa.synthetic
Title: Synthetic HR Datasets Conforming to padm
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("paVerse", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Generates seeded, reproducible synthetic people-analytics datasets
    (org structure, hires, events) conforming to the padm data model, for use in
    examples, tests, and teaching without any real PII. Includes a deliberately
    messy raw-export generator that mimics common HRIS vendor export shapes.
